  "verseCount": 52,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chadiŋiyi nakulombayi kumu chelili nakumishi dehi, kambanji kindi wumu hakumwila nindi, Mwanta, tuleji kulomba neyi chalejeliyi Yowanu atumbanji twindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuyila nindi, Chimukulomba ilenuŋa nenu, Tata yetu wekala mwiwulu, ijina deyi dijili. Wanta weyi winzi. Muchima weyi awili hamaseki neyi chawilaŋawu mwiwulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twinkaŋa hefuku hefuku kudya kwetu kutunakeŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twanakeni nyiloŋa yetu, muloŋa ninetu nawa twaanakenaŋa antu ejima akweti nyikudi yetu. Bayi wututwala mukwesekaku; twamwini kukutama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuyila nindi, Hadenu hadi mwinenwinyi wukweti ibwambu dindi wukuya kudi yena mukachi kawufuku nindi, Eyi ibwambu dami, nsondamishuku mankendi asatu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kunenzi ibwambu dami munjila yindi, hinikweti yakumudiishaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena amwakuli omu mukachi mwadiyi eli nindi, Kuchisu kwakwenzela dehi; nakama dehi kwami hakadidi, ni anyanami nawa, kutwesha kuhinduka nakukwinka nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukuyileja nami, hela kwonti kwindi kuhinduka nakumwinka nansaŋu yawubwambu, wukuhinduka nakumwinka yuma yejima yanakeŋiyi nansaŋu yakumuka kelayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukuyileja nami, lombenu akuyinka; keŋakeŋenu mukuwana; dondomwenenu akuyenzulwila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa ejima akulomba akutambula; muntu wukukeŋakeŋa wukuwana; wukudondomwena akumwenzulwila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wadiŋi nakufumisha demoni wakamama. Demoni chanafumiyi mudi muntu, owu kamama hakuhosha; mazaza awantu hiyakuhayama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amakwawu hiyakwila nawu, Wafumishaŋa demoni naŋovu yamwanta wawademoni Belezebuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acheŋi hiyakukeŋa chinjikijilu chakufuma mwiwulu kulonda amweseki nachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena hakwiluka yitoŋojoka yawu, hakuyila nindi, Mawanta ejima akudambula akulwaŋana, akushala kwamahembi hohu; hela akwetala dimu akudambula hiyakukolaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NiSatana niyena nawa neyi wukudambula yomweni, wanta windi wukukola ŋahi? Nahoshi nanochu chimudi nakwila nenu nafumishaŋa demoni naŋovu yaBelezebuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi ami nafumishaŋa demoni naŋovu yaBelezebuli, indi awa anyanenu ayifumishaŋa naŋovu janyi? Dichi wena diwu akekala akwakuyisompesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi ami nafumishaŋa demoni namunu waNzambi, komana wanta waNzambi wunashiki dehi kudenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwaŋovu namanyeki dehi, neyi wukuhemba chipaŋu chindi yomweni, yuma yindi yikwikala yayiwenyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neyi kudi yena kukwinza wamubadika Ŋovu hakumufwomona, wukumutambula yitwa yindi yejima yakuhwelelaŋayi, yuma yindi yanamupupiyi hakupaŋila akwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu wabulaŋa kwikala mwinetu, wanhelaŋa; nimuntu wabulaŋa kupompesha hamu nanami, wapalaŋeshapa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Demoni wazonda chakufumayi mudi muntu, hakuya nakutambatamba kwakadi meji, amoni kwakunookela; chakukaŋanyayi kumona kwakunookela, wukwila nindi, Nifunti mwitala dami munafumini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chakwinzayi hakuwana akombakombamu dehi, apoŋomwenamu dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuya nakutambula akwawu ademoni atanu nayedi amubadika yomweni kutama, hiyakwijila mu, hiyakushakamamu; kutama kwanowu muntu kukubadika hadiŋiyi hatachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadiŋi nakuhoshayi mazu awa, mwizaza himukubidika mumbanda wumu nindi, Ivumu dakuvweli, nimayeli waamwini anakooleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yena nindi, Chalala antu akutiya mazu aNzambi hiyakwila, anakooleki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadiŋi nakuhwila mazaza awantu kudi yena, hakutachika kuhosha nindi, Awa antu achisakichi chatama hiyakukeŋa chinjikijilu, hiyakayilejachuku, akayileja chochinjikijilu chaYona hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa chabalumukiliyi Yona kwikala chinjikijilu kumesu awakwaNineve, dichi chakelayi ni mwana kamuntu kumesu awantu achisakichi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta wamumbanda wakukabeta kakuchidiilu wamba kemana nakuhisha antu achisakichi hakusompesha; muloŋa yena wafumini kwakumina maseki, enzi nakutiya maana aSolomoni; talenu, kunu kudi wabadika Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu akuNineve amba kemana nakuhisha antu achisakichi hakusompesha, muloŋa wena abalumukili munyichima hayishimwininuwu kudi Yona; talenu, kunu kudi wabadika Yona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hikwekala muntu wabutulaŋa inoŋu adisha muchisweku, hela kudikuvumika ibaŋuku; wukudisha hamesa kulonda antu akwijila akamoni to-o. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inoŋu damujimba weyi disu; neyi disu deyi dikutalaŋa mumu hohu, nimumujimba weyi wejima mukutooka to-o; neyi datama, mumujimba weyi wejima mukwi kala kwamwidima hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi babalaku wutali chachiwahi ochu chejeji chidi mudeyi, hamwaha himwidima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi neyi mumujimba weyi wejima mukwi kala kwachejeji hohu, niheyila hosi, mukwi kala kwachejeji to-o, neyi chelaŋa inoŋu dasweja kutoŋeka, dakutoŋekelaŋa to-o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu hadiŋi nakuhoshayi, kaFwarisi wumu hakumutambi ka nindi adiyi nindi; hakwijila, hakushakama nakudya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owu kaFwarisi chanamoniyi wudi nakudya chakadi kusambila kwisuka, hakuhayama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta hakumwila nindi, Enu aFwarisi mwatookeshaŋa hanzi yalupasa nicheŋa, hakwila mukachi kenu chochimwadisoma nanyilami nikutama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu o kusupa! Welili chahanzi hidiyi welili nichamukachi nawaku, tahindi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwila yuma yayiwahi yowu wukutookesha mukachi, dichi mukumona yuma yejima yikutooka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O yihuŋu yimwakamona enu aFwarisi! Mwamulambu laŋa Nzambi tumafu twamwikumi twamavumba amawahi twejima, hakwila kusompesha nikukeŋa kwaNzambi kuchisha kumuchima nchi; neyi mwela yeniyi, ninoyu yi kwawu himwadi kuyikaŋanya kuyilaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O yihuŋu yimwakamona enu aFwarisi! Mwakeŋa aŋa kushakama mumashikola hayitwamu yalema, nikuyimwosha kuwulandilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O yihuŋu yimwakamona! muloŋa mudi neyi majamu akadi kumwekana, akadi kwilulta antu akwendahu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwanshimbi wumu hakumwakula nindi, Eyi Nkuluŋaŋa, ichi chiwunahoshi wunasawuli ninetu nawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakumwila nindi, O yihuŋu yimwakamona ninenu akwanshimbi nawa! Mulona mwatwikaŋa akwenu yiteli yakala kusenda, enu aweni kwiteja kukunkaku hela namunu wenu nehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O yihuŋu yenu! Mwaloŋeshaŋa chachiwahi majamu awatuprofwetu ajahiluwu kudi ankakulula jenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi munekali dehi ayinsahu, mudi nskwiteja nyidimu yelili ankakulula jenu; muloŋa wena ayijahili, enu mwenda namutuŋiulula majamu awu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwomwahosha dehi maana aNzambi nindi, Nukuyitemeshela atuprofwetu nawapostolu; amakwawu akayijaha nikuyikabisha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kulonda mashi awatuprofwetu ejima apwekesheluwu kufumisha haaliluwu chikuku champata yamunu mwishina, amba kayihulamu antu achisakichi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kufumisha kumashi aAbeli kushika nikumashi aZakariya ajahililuwu hakachi kakameŋa namwajila. Eŋa, nukuyileja nami amba kayihulamu antu achisakichi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O yihuŋu yimwakamona enu akwanshimbi! Munafumishi nsaŋi yakwiluka nachu maana; enu aweni kwijila mu nehi, himukulekesha ninawa akukeŋa kwijila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
